Setup			3d_sbbh

### Disk parameters

AspectRatio     	0.02            Thickness over Radius in the disc
Sigma0		    	1.0e-4		    Surface Density at r=1
Alpha			    1.0e-3	    	Uniform kinematic viscosity  
SigmaSlope		    1.0		        Slope of surface
FlaringIndex		0.0             Slope for the aspect-ratio


### Binary parameters 

Bbhomegaratio   12.856406460551014          Omega_b_in_rotating_frame - Omega_K
Bbhseparation   0.003734503955464305        Binary separation


### Sinks

GammaSink    4.0
RSink        0.000448
DeltaSink    0.0                     # for torq free: dsink=0  

# Radial range for damping (in period-ratios). Values smaller than one
# prevent damping.

DampingZone     1.15

# Characteristic time for damping, in units of the inverse local
# orbital frequency. Higher values means lower damping

TauDamp         0.3

ExcludeHill     yes

### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig		planets/sbbh.cfg
ThicknessSmoothing 	0.022408	Smoothing parameters in disk thickness (ts = 3*deltaR/H)


### Numerical method parameters

Disk			YES
OmegaFrame     		1.0
Frame			F
IndirectTerm		No

### Mesh parameters

Nx              1632              # Azimuthal
Ny              800              # Radial
Nz              516               # Colatitude

Xmin            -3.14159265358979323844
Xmax             3.14159265358979323844

Ymin            0.4
Ymax            2.5

Zmin            1.42079632679489661922   
Zmax            1.72079632679489661922  

### Non-uniform spacing

Spacing         N                     # Non-uniform, from mesh-density function
XMa             0.02
XMb             0.05
XMc             34.75

YMa             0.02
YMb             0.05
YMc             34.6
YMy0            1.0                   # Refinement center in r

ZMA             0.02                  # new   
ZMB             0.05
ZMC             31.4
ZMZ0            1.5707963267948966    # center in  pi/2

### Output control parameters

DT			    0.01570796326795  	Time step length. 2PI = 1 orbit around the SMBH
Ninterm	 		65		            Time steps between outputs
Ntot			1300		        Total number of time steps


OutputDir		@outputs/3d_sbbh_lambda4_gamma4_free1


Field 			gasdens
PlotLine		field[-1,:,:]
